        <h1>keep the wall.<br /><em>bring your own tablet.</em></h1>
        <p class="sub">
          The big idea is completely right: your family's week, chores and meals belong on the wall,
          not buried in six separate phones. What I'd skip is paying for a screen you already own.
          Our <em>beanie wall</em> does the same job on any tablet in the house, and your family's
          data stays in your hands.
        </p>

